WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:42.640
<i>Eyesmon, who created a fake Tokyo
in the Digital World,</i>

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.060
<i>evolved into Ultimate Digimon Orochimon.</i>

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.480
<i>The Chosen Ones worked together
and defeated Orochimon.</i>

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:05.620
<i>But suddenly, a mysterious countdown
began in both the real and fake Tokyo.</i>

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.640
What's this countdown?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.000
What's going on now?!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.980
It's on all the phones! Why?

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:45.120
COUNTDOWN TO TOKYO'S ANNIHILATION

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:49.370
Power's returning to our world.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.500
But...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.630
what's this countdown?

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.440
I've got a bad feeling...

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.470
Yeah.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.060
What is it?

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.150
There's still something left?!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.250
Taichi...

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.190
Yeah.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.190
Everyone, stay alert!

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.120
What's going on?!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.310
The same phenomenon is happening!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.210
What?!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.090
A phenomenon similar to that spark...

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:39.510
is occurring in the real Tokyo too!

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.100
Taichi!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:55.920
Orochimon?

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.900
Orochimon was alive?!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.280
Oh, no!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:13.120
There's massive amounts of energy flowing
from the real world into this world!

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:31.030
What on earth is going on?

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.310
That's hot!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.980
My phone's getting hot!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.650
O-Ow!

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:08.550
NIDHOGGMON

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.660
U-Unreadable...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.470
<i>I, Nidhoggmon,</i>

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:35.960
<i>a Mega Digimon
that surpasses the Ultimate Digimon.</i>

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.830
Mega... Digimon?

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:44.090
An existence that evolved further
than an Ultimate Digimon...

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.590
a Mega Digimon!

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.820
Yamato...

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.170
It feels kind of hot!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:28.550
That Digimon...

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:34.310
As the countdown continues, that Digimon
gets more energy and becomes hotter!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.870
All Network Energy that has been activated
by Tokyo's disaster up to now

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.560
is being charged into that Digimon!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.780
A-And that means what?

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.240
That Digimon's existence itself...

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.530
is linked to our world.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.950
Linked?!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:56.580
Which means...

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.790
<i>When the countdown reaches zero...</i>

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.340
<i>that Digimon's energy
will be released all at once.</i>

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:07.710
<i>And I suspect
that Tokyo will be annihilated!</i>

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.050
Yamato!

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:13.360
Agumon.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.890
Yeah, let's put an end to this!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.730
Agumon!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.560
I'm okay, Taichi.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.320
We have to do this!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.570
Hikari! Hikari!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:38.110
I-Is everyone alive?

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.270
Yes, somehow...

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.270
The countdown has...

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:45.940
two minutes left.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.270
Koshiro-san...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.510
We have to... stop all this!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.290
Let's do it, Taichi!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.690
We have to protect everyone!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.460
Yeah, with our hands!

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.010
Let's go!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:16.050
Yeah!

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:17.550
Gabumon!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:20.430
Agumon!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.350
Taichi!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.190
Yamato!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.030
Agumon Evolution!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.410
Gabumon Evolution!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.910
Greymon!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.660
Garurumon!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.680
Fox Fire!

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.210
Mega Flame!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.270
That's...

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.280
Omegamon!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.220
Omegamon...

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:07.560
That's the Digimon who protected Tokyo
from the missile!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.560
What?!

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.690
One minute left in the countdown!

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.710
Nidhoggmon's
absorbed energy level is growing!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.300
It's an enormous amount!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.680
Forty seconds left!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.540
Taichi... Yamato...

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:06.510
Yes!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:08.760
But...

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:13.350
Nidhoggmon's absorbed energy level
has increased further.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.610
At this rate...

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.650
Is Nidhoggmon trying to release
a tremendous amount of energy?!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.050
Say what?!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:33.860
It stopped?

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.120
The countdown stopped.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.600
My phone's not hot anymore.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.840
What in the world was that?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.350
Hikari! Hikari!

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.330
Hikari!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.490
Mom.

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:03.850
I'm so glad!

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:21.790
Yeah...

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.100
Mom, Taichi's okay.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.040
What?

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.500
I can tell.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:41.060
Looks like Tokyo's countdown also stopped!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.080
Hooray!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.690
Oh, thank goodness!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:54.240
By the way, who is this Omegamon?

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:35.740
Huh?!

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:37.650
This is...

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.070
What's wrong?

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:42.120
The countdown is at...

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.370
<i>Zero!</i>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.400
Piyomon!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.630
Sora!

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.780
Gomamon!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.600
Palmon!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.600
Tentomon!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:13.900
You guys!

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.340
What happened?

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.910
Everybody's all gone...

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.200
Agumon!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.330
You okay?

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.690
Yamato! Gabumon!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:56.480
When the fake Tokyo was disappearing,

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.850
I felt a strange presence.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.400
A strange presence?

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:05.780
Now what?

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:14.880
The human world is our feed.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.380
The fabricated city
may have turned to ashes,

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:23.380
but this connection
is an inalterable fate.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.070
Was it you?!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.890
The one behind this fabricated Tokyo?!

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.060
And our world's disaster?!

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:34.810
Light exists only to be swallowed
by darkness.

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.290
Resistance equals death.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.330
Answer me!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.980
Where's the Holy Digimon?!

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.840
We'll meet again when we reach our goal.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:14.390
At this rate, something will probably
happen again in our world.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.900
Yeah. We gotta find everyone first.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:32.930
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.080
<i>Togemon.</i>

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:37.240
<i>This Digimon evolves from Palmon.</i>

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:37.240
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:39.200
<i>The Prickly Bang-Bang move</i>

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:40.250
TYPE: PLANT

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>shoots prickly, hard needles
from the body like bullets!</i>

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:43.190
SPECIAL MOVE: PRICKLY BANG-BANG

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.340
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:48.260
<i>Togemon has eyes and a mouth
that look like </i>Haniwa<i>,</i>

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.090
<i>but I always worry
if any sand builds up inside.</i>

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:53.550
<i>Actually, I wonder what it's like inside.</i>

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>I'll check next time!</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.960
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:05.280
<i>Taichi and Yamato sneak
into the enormous Valvemon.</i>

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.730
<i>What is the truth that awaits them?</i>

00:23:07.730 --> 00:23:11.570
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Howl, Jyuoken"</i>

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.120
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
